  "issue": {
    "body": "In light of the issues and PRs relating to `BaseHTTPMiddleware` we need to improve the documentation on this middleware class and give some good guidance on how to write custom middleware. Documentation on this should include the following:\r\n\r\n- A warning not to use `BaseHTTPMiddleware` with `StreamingResponse` or `FileResponse` endpoints.\r\n- A note on how background will be evaluated with respect to `BaseHTTPMiddleware`.\r\n- Instructions on how to write custom ASGI Middleware with example code (can be based on an [example from the codebase](https://github.com/encode/starlette/blob/master/starlette/middleware/authentication.py#L14)).\r\n- A gentle suggestion to favor custom ASGI Middleware over subclassing `BaseHTTPMiddleware`.\r\n\r\nSee related issues and PRs:\r\n\r\n- #919 \r\n- #1012 \r\n- #1022 \r\n- #1028 ",
    "closed_at": "2022-06-30T18:38:43Z",
    "created_at": "2020-08-13T14:14:47Z",
    "html_url": "https://github.com/Kludex/starlette/issues/1029",
    "labels": [
      "documentation"
    ],
    "number": 1029,
    "state": "closed",
    "title": "Improve Documentation on Writing Custom ASGI Middleware and BaseHTTPMiddleware",
    "user": "erewok"
  },
